Pizza Legacy v@PLEGACY_VERSION_FULL@ - Linux Release
===============================================

@README_INTRO@

RUNNING
-------

Make the AppImage executable and run it:

    chmod +x PizzaLegacy_v@PLEGACY_VERSION_FULL@_linux-x86_64.AppImage
    ./PizzaLegacy_v@PLEGACY_VERSION_FULL@_linux-x86_64.AppImage


@README_REQUIREMENTS@


@README_STATUS@


THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
--------------------
This build includes third-party libraries (SDL3, zlib, libADLMIDI).
Their individual licenses are included inside the AppImage at:
`usr/share/licenses/plegacy/`
A summary of all third-party components can be found in
`usr/share/doc/plegacy/THIRD_PARTIES.txt`.


@README_LICENSE@
LICENSE.txt (in usr/share/licenses/plegacy/) contains the full license text.
Source code: https://codeberg.org/cowomaly/pizzalegacy/
